WEBVTT

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.656
On the Hours and overflow card, pick a Business hours calendar.

00:00:07.656 --> 00:00:10.623
Routing pauses while the queue is closed.

00:00:10.623 --> 00:00:15.420
The After-hours action is Hold in queue, or Overflow to another queue.

00:00:15.885 --> 00:00:19.432
Overflow queue and Overflow after set a single hop:

00:00:19.432 --> 00:00:24.285
after that many seconds of waiting, the caller moves to the other queue.

00:00:24.285 --> 00:00:27.335
Add overflow hop builds a chain of several.

00:00:27.813 --> 00:00:33.387
On the Limits card, Maximum callers waiting and Maximum wait cap the line.

00:00:33.387 --> 00:00:37.917
Queue-full action and Maximum-wait action say what happens:

00:00:37.917 --> 00:00:40.913
admit anyway, overflow, or voicemail.

